/**
 * @page about About
 * @section about-klv klv
 * klv is a header-only C++23 library that decodes and encodes KLV
 * (SMPTE 336) metadata. It includes definitions for MISB ST 0601 and the
 * local sets that nest in it: ST 0102, ST 0806, ST 0903, ST 1002, ST 1202,
 * ST 1206, ST 1601, ST 1602, and ST 1607.
 *
 * Each field is a struct with a tag, a name and a constexpr codec. Each set
 * is a list of fields, and @c klv::record holds one typed value for each
 * field of a set.
 */
